      "title": "START HERE",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### START HERE - Real ComfyUI Workflow\n1. Paste/edit the cue sheet in the Yvann Cue Sheet Parser textbox.\n2. Set audio_path to the 2-hour mix in ComfyUI input. That same value feeds the visible audio loader/preview.\n3. Press Queue.\nThe parser outputs a batch plan; the generator launches the longform job; Generated Batch Images Output exposes the generated images as an IMAGE output and thumbnails.\nSet max_chunks=2 for a smoke test, or 0 for the full mix. Set launch_now=false and Queue to refresh outputs without starting another job."
      ]
    },
