      "flags": {},
      "order": 2,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "HOW IT CONNECTS TO YVANN",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### How generated images reach Yvann\nGenerated Batch Images Output is the visible preview/output socket.\nThe actual Yvann render connection happens inside QUEUE THIS: it reads yvann_workflow_path, generates images for each chunk, copies them to ComfyUI input, replaces Yvann LoadImage nodes with those files, replaces LoadAudio with the chunk audio, then queues Yvann output node 410.\nSo: preview output = see images; launcher = feeds images into Yvann per timestamp batch."
      ]
    },
